    {
      "body": "`lit_model` doesn't exist because your kernel restarted \u2014 you're at `In[11]`, and cell 10 (which creates `lit_model`) hasn't run in this session.\n\nRun these cells in order first: **5 \u2192 6 \u2192 7 \u2192 8 \u2192 9 \u2192 10**, then the fit cell.\n\nI under-specified this earlier when I said \"5, 6, 7, 10\" \u2014 you also need 8 (creates the `FlareMetrics` objects) and 9 (defines `Flare2DLightningModule`), because cell 10 consumes both.\n\nLet me check what survived the restart:",
