      "id": "117bed22-788f-400f-8388-77ffed799768",
      "body": "ok so this is running now. i guess i leave it. now should i still run this stuff? cell 26, 28?\n\nexpected = trainer.max_epochs * len(train_data_loader)\nprint(\"status         :\", trainer.state.status)        # 'finished' when fit completed\nprint(\"epochs done    :\", trainer.current_epoch, \"of\", trainer.max_epochs)\nprint(\"optimizer steps:\", trainer.global_step, \"of\", expected)\nif trainer.global_step < expected:\n    print(\"  ^^ STOPPED EARLY -- the max_time={'minutes': 45} guard fired\")\nprint(\"checkpoint     :\", trainer.checkpoint_callback.last_model_path or \"(none written)\")\n\ntrainer.save_checkpoint(\"interrupted_33steps.ckpt\")\nimport wandb\nif wandb.run is not None: wandb.run.finish()",
      "raw_time": false,
      "sender": "jpereira",
      "type": "msg",
      "time": 1789674238.8581264,
      "metadata": {
        "to_persona": "jupyter-ai-personas::jupyter_ai_acp_client::ClaudeAcpPersona",
