    {
      "body": "is my trainer.fit done running? Training: |          | 0/? [00:00<?, ?it/s]\n[19:44:23] step   1/32  loss 0.2269  compute   4.1s  data-wait   0.0s  209.1s/step  ETA 108.0m\n[19:44:52] step   2/32  loss 0.3401  compute   2.1s  data-wait  26.7s  118.9s/step  ETA 59.5m\n[19:44:55] step   3/32  loss 0.3342  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   80.3s/step  ETA 38.8m\n[19:44:58] step   4/32  loss 0.2451  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   60.9s/step  ETA 28.4m\n[19:45:01] step   5/32  loss 0.2499  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   49.3s/step  ETA 22.2m\n[19:45:04] step   6/32  loss 0.2190  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   41.6s/step  ETA 18.0m\n[19:45:07] step   7/32  loss 0.2425  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   36.1s/step  ETA 15.0m\n[19:45:10] step   8/32  loss 0.5790  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   31.9s/step  ETA 12.8m\n[19:47:10] step   9/32  loss 0.2055  compute   2.1s  data-wait 118.2s   41.7s/step  ETA 16.0m\n[19:47:58] step  10/32  loss 0.2270  compute   2.1s  data-wait  45.3s   42.3s/step  ETA 15.5m\n[19:48:00] step  11/32  loss 0.2934  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   38.7s/step  ETA 13.6m\n[19:48:03] step  12/32  loss 0.1964  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   35.7s/step  ETA 11.9m\n[19:48:32] step  13/32  loss 0.2372  compute   2.1s  data-wait  26.4s   35.2s/step  ETA 11.1m\n[19:48:35] step  14/32  loss 0.2660  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   32.9s/step  ETA  9.9m\n[19:48:38] step  15/32  loss 0.2023  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   30.9s/step  ETA  8.7m\n[19:48:41] step  16/32  loss 0.2648  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   29.1s/step  ETA  7.8m\n[19:51:51] step  17/32  loss 0.2576  compute   2.1s  data-wait 188.2s   38.6s/step  ETA  9.7m\n[19:53:03] step  18/32  loss 0.2880  compute   2.1s  data-wait  69.9s   40.5s/step  ETA  9.4m\n[19:53:06] step  19/32  loss 0.2354  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   38.5s/step  ETA  8.3m\n[19:53:09] step  20/32  loss 0.2623  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   36.7s/step  ETA  7.3m\n[19:53:12] step  21/32  loss 0.2231  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   35.1s/step  ETA  6.4m\n[19:53:15] step  22/32  loss 0.2362  compute   2.1s  data-wait   1.0s   33.6s/step  ETA  5.6m\n[19:53:18] step  23/32  loss 0.3274  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   32.3s/step  ETA  4.8m\n[19:53:21] step  24/32  loss 0.2063  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   31.1s/step  ETA  4.1m\n[19:54:55] step  25/32  loss 0.2800  compute   2.1s  data-wait  92.6s   33.6s/step  ETA  3.9m\n[19:55:21] step  26/32  loss 0.2599  compute   2.1s  data-wait  23.5s   33.3s/step  ETA  3.3m\n[19:55:24] step  27/32  loss 0.2331  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   32.2s/step  ETA  2.7m\n[19:55:27] step  28/32  loss 0.2911  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   31.1s/step  ETA  2.1m\n[19:55:30] step  29/32  loss 0.2769  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   30.2s/step  ETA  1.5m\n[19:55:32] step  30/32  loss 0.4164  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   29.3s/step  ETA  1.0m\n[19:55:35] step  31/32  loss 0.2246  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   28.4s/step  ETA  0.5m\n[19:55:38] step  32/32  loss 0.2123  compute   2.1s  data-wait   0.8s   27.6s/step  ETA  0.0m\n`Trainer.fit` stopped: `max_epochs=1` reached.\n[19:55:38] END status=TrainerStatus.RUNNING step=32/32",
